---
title: "invest (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: investor submits sealed bid
    q_check_paused --> q_check_period: not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: contract paused
    q_check_period --> q_verify_sig: block.timestamp >= startTime AND block.timestamp < endTime
    q_check_period --> q_revert_period: outside active sale period
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_amount: signature valid from authorized signer
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: invalid signature
    q_check_amount --> q_validate_bid: amount >= minimumInvestAmount
    q_check_amount --> q_revert_amount: below minimum
    q_validate_bid --> q_check_salt: encryptedAmountOut provided, sealedBidPublicKey matches auction publicKey
    q_validate_bid --> q_revert_bid: invalid bid data or wrong public key
    q_check_salt --> q_update: salt == uint256(uint160(investor)) (salt must equal investor address)
    q_check_salt --> q_revert_salt: invalid salt
    q_update --> q_transfer: position.investedCapital += amount, position.encryptedBid = bidData, totalInvestedCapital += amount
    q_transfer --> q_emit: transferFrom(investor, address(this), amount)
    q_transfer --> q_revert_transfer: transfer failed
    q_emit --> [*]: emit Invested(investor, amount, encryptedAmountOut)
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert Paused
    q_revert_period --> [*]: revert InvalidPeriod
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_revert_amount --> [*]: revert BelowMinimum
    q_revert_bid --> [*]: revert InvalidBidData
    q_revert_salt --> [*]: revert InvalidSalt
    q_revert_transfer --> [*]: revert TransferFailed

    note right of q_validate_bid
        INV-001: Encrypted bid uses ECIES with auction's public key
        INV-002: Salt must equal investor address to bind bid to investor identity
        INV-003: Bid amount (capital) is visible on-chain, desired token amount is encrypted
    end note
